      "content_am": "«በተቋጠሩ (ክሮች) ላይ ተፊዎች ከኾኑት (ደጋሚ) ሴቶችም ክፋት፡፡",
      "content_en_si": "And from the evil of the blowers in knots",
      "content_sw": "Na shari ya wanao pulizia mafundoni,",
      "content_en_tr": "Wamin sharri alnnaffathati fee alAAuqadi"
    },
